# LICENCE BOUNDARY, not an optimisation. A Space is PUBLIC, and data/cache and
# data/raw hold SID_Set, So-Fake-OOD and a CC BY-NC face corpus whose licences
# do not permit redistribution. The demo needs NONE of it -- inference reads
# data/models/*.npz (305 KB) and nothing else. If a build fails for a missing
# file, fix the code path, do not open a hole here.
data/cache/
data/raw/
data/manifests/
data/models/backup_*/

# NOTE: all seven data/models/*.npz ARE needed -- general and tampered (the
# scorer), face, spectral and text_crop (branches), fusion (its Platt constants
# only) and content_prompts (the zero-shot content label). 305 KB total.

.git/
.github/
.venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
scratchpad/
notebooks/

# Docs and figures are for the repo, not the runtime image.
docs/
test-images/variants/
preds.json
*.json.tmp
